sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as Program (vital code)
    Note over P,UI: Only while the CTC Office has a switch command in effect (maintenance, UC-11).
    P->>UI: click Set switch manually
    UI->>S: switches
    S-->>UI: return each switch, its position, legs and CTC command
    P->>UI: choose a switch, Normal or Reverse, Apply
    UI->>S: setSwitch(id, reverse)
    alt controller.maintenance is false
        S-->>UI: raise RuntimeError: only while the CTC has maintenance on
    else maintenance
        S->>S: setSwitch internal: controller.manual_switches[id] := reverse
        S->>W: scan()
        W->>W: build_scan_inputs internal: HAND_s, HANDREV_s, CTCCMD_s, CTCREV_s
        W->>V: scan(image + the program's outputs)
        V-->>W: return OUT_SW_s: CTC command, else hand-set, else program
        S-->>UI: emit maintenanceChanged, controllerChanged
        UI-->>P: switch shown as hand-set (the CTC command wins if any)
    end
    opt release
        P->>UI: click Release
        UI->>S: releaseSwitch(id)
        S->>S: releaseSwitch internal: controller.manual_switches.pop(id)
        S->>W: scan()
    end
    Note right of W: Sent to the Track Model on the next step (UC-13). set_maintenance(False) releases it.
